### ===================================================================
### BỘ TEST API — CRM ShoesStore (theo schema có Employee)
### .env cần: TEST_ADMIN_USER/PASS, TEST_MANAGER_USER/PASS, TEST_CUSTOMER_USER/PASS
### Chạy mục 0 trước để lấy token. Sửa các @id cho khớp dữ liệu.
### ===================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@customerId = 3
@productId = 1
@feedbackId = 1
@surveyId = 1
@questionId = 1
@categoryId = 1
@supplierId = 1
@bannerId = 1
@accountId = 5

### 0.1 Customer
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{$dotenv TEST_CUSTOMER_USER}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_CUSTOMER_PASS}}" }

@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 0.2 Admin (response.account có employee: { employeeId, employeeCode, fullName, ... })
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{$dotenv TEST_ADMIN_USER}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_ADMIN_PASS}}" }

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 0.3 Manager
# @name managerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{$dotenv TEST_MANAGER_USER}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_MANAGER_PASS}}" }

@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 0.4 Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ===================== 1. TÀI KHOẢN & HỒ SƠ NHÂN VIÊN =====================
### 1.1 Đăng ký khách hàng
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "testuser2026", "email": "testuser2026@example.com", "password": "Test@123", "fullName": "Người Dùng Test", "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-01", "gender": "Nam", "phone": "0988777666", "address": "123 Nguyễn Trãi, Q.5, TP.HCM" }

### 1.2 Tài khoản đang đăng nhập
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 1.3 Hồ sơ Employee của chính mình (Admin/Manager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 1.4 Cập nhật hồ sơ Employee (ghi nhật ký)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Trần Minh Quản Lý", "email": "manager@ouran.com", "phone": "0901000002", "gender": "Nam", "dateOfBirth": "1995-06-20", "address": "45 Lê Lợi, Q.1, TP.HCM" }

### 1.5 Đổi mật khẩu
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "oldPassword": "Test@123", "newPassword": "Test@1234" }

### 1.6 Quên mật khẩu: gửi OTP -> kiểm tra -> đặt lại
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "testuser2026@example.com" }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "testuser2026@example.com", "otp": "123456" }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "testuser2026@example.com", "otp": "123456", "newPassword": "Test@12345" }

### 1.7 Danh sách / chi tiết tài khoản (Admin; có customer hoặc employee)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 1.8 Khóa / mở khóa (ghi nhật ký)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 1.9 Đổi vai trò (lên Admin/Manager sẽ tự tạo Employee)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleName": "Manager" }

### 1.10 Admin tạo tài khoản nội bộ -> tạo cả Employee (fullName tùy chọn)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "manager2", "email": "manager2@ouran.com", "password": "Manager@123", "roleName": "Manager", "fullName": "Lê Quản Lý Hai" }

### 1.11 Staff thêm khách hàng (customers.created_by = employee tạo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "khach_moi", "email": "khachmoi@example.com", "password": "Khach@123", "fullName": "Khách Mới", "dateOfBirth": "1999-09-09", "gender": "Nữ", "phone": "0911222333", "address": "Q.1, TP.HCM" }

### 1.12 Thống kê / online / vai trò
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/online-count
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===================== 2. DANH MỤC (xóa mềm) =====================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryName": "Boots", "description": "Giày bốt" }

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryName": "Sneaker", "description": "Giày sneaker thời trang" }

### Xóa mềm (409 nếu còn sản phẩm; tạo lại cùng tên sẽ khôi phục)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===================== 3. SẢN PHẨM =====================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?includeInactive=true

### category = TÊN danh mục, hoặc categoryId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?brand=Nike&category=Sneaker&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/feedbacks

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "supplierId": {{supplierId}}, "categoryId": {{categoryId}}, "productName": "Giày Chạy Bộ Ultra Boost 2026", "brand": "Adidas", "size": "40/41/42", "color": "Trắng/Xám", "material": "Vải dệt cao cấp", "price": 1850000, "stockQuantity": 50, "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/seed/ultraboost/600/600" }

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": {{categoryId}}, "productName": "Giày Sneaker Classic V2", "price": 950000, "stockQuantity": 80 }

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

### ===================== 4. NHÀ CUNG CẤP (xóa mềm) =====================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/search?keyword=Sài Gòn

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/products

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "supplierName": "Công ty Giày Miền Tây", "phone": "0283777888", "email": "contact@mientay.vn", "address": "Cần Thơ" }

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "supplierName": "Công ty Giày Miền Tây", "phone": "0283000111" }

### Xóa mềm (409 nếu còn sản phẩm)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===================== 5. BANNER (xóa mềm, ghi nhật ký) =====================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/banners

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/banners/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/banners
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/seed/banner1/1600/500", "title": "Khuyến mãi mùa hè", "sortOrder": 0, "isActive": true }

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/banners/{{bannerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Banner đã sửa", "sortOrder": 1 }

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/banners/{{bannerId}}/active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/banners/{{bannerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===================== 6. KHÁCH HÀNG & SỞ THÍCH =====================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/report
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/search?keyword=Nguyễn&gender=Nam
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn An", "dateOfBirth": "2000-05-15", "gender": "Nam", "phone": "0901234567", "email": "nguyenvana@example.com", "address": "123 Nguyễn Trãi, Q.1, TP.HCM" }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "preferenceTag": "Giày Sneaker" }

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/preferences/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Xóa mềm khách hàng (ghi nhật ký)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### ===================== 7. ĐÁNH GIÁ & PHẢN HỒI =====================
### Khách gửi (1 lần/60s, tối đa 10/ngày)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feedbacks
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": {{customerId}}, "productId": {{productId}}, "title": "Giày đi rất êm và bền", "content": "Đi bộ cả ngày không bị đau gót chân.", "rating": 5 }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/feedbacks
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Khách sửa — chỉ khi Pending (409 nếu đã xử lý)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/feedbacks/{{feedbackId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Giày rất êm (đã sửa)", "content": "Sau 1 tuần vẫn rất thoải mái.", "rating": 4 }

### Khách thu hồi (xóa mềm) khi Pending
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/feedbacks/{{feedbackId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Manager xem (mới nhất trước; có handler, replies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feedbacks?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Duyệt/từ chối -> feedbacks.handled_by = employee_id của Manager
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/feedbacks/{{feedbackId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Approved" }

### Trả lời — CHỈ khi đã Approved (409 nếu chưa), review_replies.employee_id = Manager
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feedbacks/{{feedbackId}}/replies
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Cảm ơn bạn đã chia sẻ! Ouran rất vui vì bạn hài lòng." }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feedbacks/{{feedbackId}}/replies
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/replies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Nội dung phản hồi đã chỉnh sửa." }

### Xóa mềm phản hồi
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/replies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### ===================== 8. KHẢO SÁT (surveys.created_by = employee_id) =====================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/simple
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Khảo sát xu hướng Thu Đông 2026", "description": "Thăm dò ý kiến khách hàng", "isActive": true, "productId": null }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "surveyId": {{surveyId}}, "questionContent": "Bạn thích màu nào nhất?", "questionType": "SINGLE_CHOICE", "options": ["Đen", "Trắng"] }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/options
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "questionId": {{questionId}}, "optionText": "Xanh pastel" }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/{{surveyId}}/full
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/{{surveyId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerIds": [3, 4, 5] }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/{{surveyId}}/targets
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Khách xem khảo sát của mình
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/surveys
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Khách nộp (trả lời ĐỦ mọi câu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/{{surveyId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": {{customerId}}, "answers": [ { "questionId": 1, "answerValue": "Đen", "optionId": 1 }, { "questionId": 2, "answerValue": "Mong shop làm thêm màu sáng." } ] }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/{{surveyId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/{{surveyId}}/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/{{surveyId}}/active
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

